  "description": "pre order #3 is now closed. we may have some extra sizes after production in January 2027.\nTotal price is $2,300 raw or an extra $120 for custom 1 color powder coat. price here reflects deposit amount. Delivery is December 2026.\nExcited to offer this mid reach country road bike made right here Deep River CT.\nthe information you will want to make an informed decision is available on this updated blog post. I will still place this geo chart below as well as have a bunch of photos for you to click though here.\nWe sized these bikes according to their top tube length, so measure accordingly. The CR1 is designed with modern road geometry in mind with a longer front center and steeper ST, I think you will like it. it's all modern under the hood. Everything you need, nothing you don't.\npowder options bellow, but we can really do anything you like from Prismatic Powder. I will reach out to the pre orderers once the time comes for coating. If you request RAW, you will get a decalled raw frame coated in lanolin based Fluid Film. to keep your raw frame protected, I would recommend wiping some on every 6 months or so.\n\nif you have any questions, feel free to email me ronnie@ronsbikes.com",
